    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i can't really get to a doctor until next week and it's getting more painful. it's just a small cyst right? i really don't want to risk a huge infection something like that. if i'm super careful and just do a tiny nick, isn't that basically what a doctor would do anyway? just to let the pressure out?",
