      "content": "the warm compress thing sounds okay but what if the pain gets way worse tonight? like if i start feeling feverish or if the redness starts spreading out from the bump... should i just take some extra ibuprofen or something to handle it until my appointment? or is there anything else i can take at home to stop it from getting worse?",
